==Reactions==
Following his victory, Morales vowed "I will try with all my heart and strength not to disappoint you."<ref>[http://www.ft.com/intl/cms/s/0/cab0d5b4-7b42-11e5-a1fe-567b37f80b64.html Ex-comedian Jimmy Morales in landslide Guatemala election victory] ''Financial Times'', 26 October 2015</ref> The US-based [[National Public Radio]] described this a rightward shift among voters in both the Americas and Europe.<ref>[https://www.npr.org/sections/thetwo-way/2015/10/26/452006785/voters-in-poland-guatemala-and-argentina-surprise-establishment-candidates Voters In Poland, Guatemala And Argentina Surprise Establishment Candidates] NPR, 26 October 2015</ref>

